<view class="page login-page">
  <view class="brand">
    <view class="brand-mark">♡</view>
    <view>
      <view class="brand-title">莓好审批</view>
      <view class="brand-subtitle">把每一份申请，轻轻送到你手边</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="flower">🎀</view>
    <view class="login-title">登录莓好审批</view>
    <view class="muted login-copy">首次登录会自动建立小程序账号，由管理员统一安排审核人。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
    <input class="field" placeholder="账号" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="onInput" />
    <input class="field" password placeholder="密码" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="onInput" />
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="accountSignIn">账号登录</button>
    <view class="dev-divider">或</view>
    <button class="dev-button" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="wechatSignIn">微信一键登录</button>
  </view>
  <view class="tip">使用平台账号或微信均可登录；首次成功登录后会自动出现在后台人员管理中。</view>
</view>
